<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's Sampoerna says 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's Sampoerna says 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian cigarette company PT Hanjaya Mandala Sampoerna said on Thursday it posted a net profit of 394 billion rupiah in 1996, compared with 352.46 billion rupiah in 1995.  </p>
<p>Ekadharmajanto Kasih, chief financial officer of Sampoerna, told an analysts' meeting the firm has forecast its net profit to rise to 528.25 billion rupiah in 1997 and to 602.92 billion rupiah in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
